###  http://aiod.eu/data/schemas/Publishing
:Publishing rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                     ns1:Concept ;
            ns1:broader :InformationAndCommunicationTechnologies ;
            ns1:inScheme :BusinessSector ;
            ns1:notation "con361"@en ;
